<title>BELGIUM: BRUSSELS BEL-20 INDEX RISES 1.02 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>BRUSSELS BEL-20 INDEX RISES 1.02 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brussels Bel-20 share index rose more than one percent in early afternoon trading on Monday, more then recouping Friday's losses and less than 10 points off its life high of 2,233.65.</p>
<p>At 1235 GMT the bourse was 1.03 percent higher at 2,224.91 points, although traders noted that only one billion francs of Belgian shares had changed hands.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
